00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:42.320
No matter who he is,

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:43.850
he can't make it.

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:46.500
Even he's a Super Chef.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:48.070
Silang.

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.060
Come and take a look.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.910
See, I made such shape of rice crust

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:57.800
with the cylinder.

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:01.660
It's a large rectangular rice crust.

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:05.260
Well, how to use this tool?

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.570
I've thought about it, too.

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:11.080
Press down like this with a circular model.

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:14.190
You see!

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:16.550
Unprecedented round rice crusts.

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:17.500
With this,

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.120
we can make different shapes.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.380
We spend so much effort,

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.280
but the rice crusts

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.240
are the same as the ordinary ones.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:25.750
And

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:27.190
what's the handle for?

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:29.360
What are these two tools

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:33.700
and these three chains for?

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:35.770
This one doesn't seem right either.

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.000
But think about it.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:40.110
The guy came at the right moment.

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:41.010
Right, Miss Yanli?

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.890
When I heard Proconsulate Lian will visit us,

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:45.760
I thought we were screwed this time.

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.030
If we fail Proconsulate Lian,

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:50.300
our restaurant's reputation

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:51.450
will be ruined.

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:52.090
At worst,

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:54.260
we'll lose all our guests.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:58.250
If a Super Chef can't do it,

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:00.600
I think the Proconsulate will accept the result.

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:01.110
In this way,

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:03.810
we won't lose our reputation.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.290
The Super Chef does a great help.

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:07.520
That's right.

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:14.380
Try hard on behalf of me,

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:16.020
Super Chef.

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:25.270
No, it's not used that way.

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:26.490
Darn it!

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.330
I can't come up with any idea.

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:30.380
What is exactly

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.100
the mysterious rice crust?

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.600
I did it.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:01.660
I'm really

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:03.000
a muscular man.

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:05.200
Hey, what are you doing?

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:07.520
Those important cooking tools

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:09.740
were invented by Master Jia Xiong.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:15.580
Should they be assembled?

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:18.280
Wait, I've seen such assembly

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:19.190
somewhere.

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:24.290
Besides fantastic shape

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.000
and wonderful presentation,

00:18:27.010 --> 00:18:29.940
it has unique, rich and sweet flavor

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:31.490
that attracted lots of people.

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:33.700
Yes, I see.

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:35.560
Thank you for helping me

00:18:35.610 --> 00:18:37.590
figure it out.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.040
Let's start.

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:40.390
Silang, come and help me.

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:44.080
Silang, it's not time to sleep.

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:53.850
They're still working on it.

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:55.160
Doesn't he know

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:57.620
that there is something in the world

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:58.850
that can't be done?

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:01.190
How could there be a blast of hot air?

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:04.510
This is...

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:21.410
It turns out that this is the secret of the tools.

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:29.420
I just have to know how to use them.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.630
Splendid work, you two.

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:39.000
Miss Yanli, morning.

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:40.940
Miss Rice Crust,

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.630
wait to see Mao's performance.

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:44.890
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:46.890
Then I'll leave you to it.

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:49.020
I put the juice here.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:50.570
Thank you.

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:52.290
Keep it up!

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:54.800
Take a break.

00:19:57.970 --> 00:19:59.570
It's so cold. So delicious!

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:06.310
What's up?

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:07.330
Silang.

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:18.880
How does the special juice taste,

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:20.540
Chef Mao?

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:23.020
Just have a good rest!

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:27.260
(Quqing Restaurant)

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:32.940
I heard she's going to make the mysterious rice crust

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:34.320
that has been lost for decades.

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:37.740
You mean Master Jia Xiong's Rice Crust Dish?

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:40.180
Then we'll have to have a look!

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:43.250
Did Mao work it out?

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:47.190
Whatever happens to Mao,

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:48.940
it is none of my business.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:51.790
It's about to start.

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:57.410
Excuse me!

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:58.330
What are you doing?

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.200
Excuse me.

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:04.720
(Yunnan Proconsulate Lian, Welcome)

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:06.880
All right.

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:09.210
Thirty years ago, I enjoyed

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:10.800
the Rice Crust Dish made by Master Jia Xiong.

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:14.100
Can you do it again today?

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:21.100
Proconsulate Lian,

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:23.700
I'm the chef of Quqing Restaurant.

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:25.000
I've already known how to cook

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:27.180
the legendary rice crust.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.130
Is it true?

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:30.960
Why her?

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:33.060
Where is Mao?

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:18.240
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.240 --> 00:23:19.647
Mao?

00:23:19.772 --> 00:23:21.983
Where have you been yet?

00:23:22.108 --> 00:23:24.653
If she's a little bit beautiful,
you'll get so excited that

00:23:24.694 --> 00:23:27.865
you won't even know that
she's taking all the credit.

00:23:27.990 --> 00:23:29.866
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.991 --> 00:23:32.535
Revive! Mystery Scorched Rice Cuisine

00:23:32.577 --> 00:23:34.038
It will definitely be interesting!
